From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 16:21:25 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Formula check: one second note when the recalculated result
 is still the one the user called wrong

sb8 (f70ea3ca, SpreadsheetBench 6 reps, 31/36): sb-56921 r1 got the note, recalculated, saw the same 511, wrote the
same formulas back and answered "Now it's right" while its own hand calculation said 294. The check may now speak a
second time, firmer, when the file still recalculates to the same result; it costs calls only on such a run.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Pf4xaMqQSJYs9jXfPpQcsK
---
 app/meshpool_harness/agent/core.py | 7 ++++++-
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/app/meshpool_harness/agent/core.py b/app/meshpool_harness/agent/core.py
index c3d358ec..83d60cc7 100644
--- a/app/meshpool_harness/agent/core.py
+++ b/app/meshpool_harness/agent/core.py
@@ -2557,7 +2557,12 @@ class Agent:
                                            ("offslide", lambda: _off_slide_miss(self.root, t0)),
                                            ("unchanged", lambda: _unchanged_output_miss(ask, self.root, t0)),
                                            ("volatile", lambda: _volatile_date_miss(ask, self.root, t0)),
-                                           ("formula", lambda: _formula_result_miss(ask, self.root, t0))):
+                                           ("formula", lambda: _formula_result_miss(ask, self.root, t0)),
+                                           # sb8 sb-56921 r1: after the first note the agent recalculated, saw the
+                                           # same 511, wrote the same formulas and answered; one second, firmer note
+                                           ("formula2", lambda: "formula" in done and _formula_result_miss(
+                                               ask, self.root, t0).replace("The job is not done:", "Still not done "
+                                               "after your last change:", 1))):
                             if key not in done:
                                 miss = check()
                                 if miss:
